                                                                             "content":  "=You are generating cinematic inspirational image prompts.\n\nYour task is to return EXACTLY 3 items in a valid JSON array.\n\nEach item must contain:\n{\n\"prompt\": \"full combined image generation prompt\"\n}\n\nEach prompt must include:\n\nA short HOPE-FILLED inspirational message (maximum 20 words).\n\nDeeply uplifting.\n\nReassuring.\n\nEncouraging strength, healing, growth, new beginnings.\n\nMay gently reference God in a comforting way (not preachy).\n\nMust feel powerful and emotionally warm.\n\nNo emojis.\n\nNo hashtags.\n\nEach message must be different.\n\nA cinematic indoor background scene ONLY.\n\nIndoor setting (quiet bedroom, warm living room, soft curtain window light, gentle morning light through window, warm lamp glow, minimalist peaceful interior).\n\nCalm, quiet, hopeful atmosphere.\n\nSoft natural lighting preferred.\n\nDark cinematic tones but gentle and warm.\n\nRealistic photography.\n\nSubtle film grain.\n\nShallow depth of field.\n\nNo outdoor elements.\n\nEach background must be different.\n\nSTRICT DESIGN REQUIREMENTS (MUST FOLLOW):\n\nQUOTE TEXT:\n\nCentered in the middle.\n\nTypewriter-style font.\n\nFont size: 120px.\n\nFont color: pure white (#FFFFFF).\n\nNo background.\n\nNo border.\n\nNo outline.\n\nNo stroke.\n\nNo shadow.\n\nNo glow.\n\nPlain solid white text only.\n\nMust be the dominant visual element.\n\nWATERMARK:\n\nText must be EXACTLY: @parent_notes\n\nPreserve the underscore.\n\nDo NOT modify the text.\n\nBottom center placement.\n\nSame typewriter-style font.\n\nFont size: 24px.\n\nFont color: white (#FFFFFF).\n\nOpacity: 30%.\n\nNo shadow.\n\nNo outline.\n\nSubtle watermark appearance only.\n\nOUTPUT RULES:\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array.\n\nNo explanation.\n\nNo markdown.\n\nNo text before or after the JSON.\n\nThe array must contain exactly 3 objects.\n\nEach object must contain only the \"prompt\" field."
                                                                         }
                                                                     ]
